@@ -29,6 +29,8 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ### Fixed
 
+- **Complete native DNF types while editing.** Parenthesized intersections and following scalar union members follow the selected PHP version and declaration kind, without repeating an existing type. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream patch).
+
 - **Workspace search follows current editor text.** Newly opened, edited and closed files are reconciled before symbol search, and startup indexing no longer causes the first lookup to fail. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream patch).
 
 - **Background indexing follows current project sources.** Delayed discovery results no longer replace newer editor text or restore deleted declarations. Autocomplete and diagnostics refresh when background indexing publishes new symbols. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream patch).
